Read `AGENTS.md` in the repository root before you do anything else.
It is the single source of project rules for all AI agents here.

Short version:

- Never commit, push, or create a branch without an explicit request.
- Verify every fact and cite `file:line`, a config key, or the exact log line.
- Search `docs/knowledge/`, `docs/decisions/`, and `docs/context/` before you read the code.
- Write documentation in {{DOC_LANGUAGE}}, with the frontmatter block from `docs/README.md`.
